# r13 head at full-body scale (3/4, facing screen-LEFT). Pixel artist 3. Hand-authored grid. (round-1 fixes)
# Landmarks as head_front: crown y5, bang cut y14 (notches x9,x17), brow y15, lash y18, iris y19-23, lower lash y24,
# blush y25-26, nose y25, mouth y27-28, chin y31. Far eye x9-12 (narrow), bridge gap x13-14, near eye x15-19 (+flick x20).
# Bow knot 5x5 on the back of the skull x30-34 y8-12; far loop peeks over the crown, near loop up-back.
